# PROJECT.md Source of Truth

Before making implementation decisions, always read `PROJECT.md`.

- Treat `PROJECT.md` as the source of truth for product direction (mission, vision, philosophy, success metric, current focus, next sprint).
- Align features, UX, and technical choices with that direction.
- If a requested change conflicts with `PROJECT.md`, explain the conflict clearly and wait for confirmation before implementing.
- Prefer decisions that reinforce Better decisions > More work, Assets > Tasks, Validation > Planning, Cashflow > Vanity, Learning > Busyness, and Compounding > Linear Growth.
